: "left", "type": "text", "updated": 1794226850312, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1519479264, "verticalAlign": "top", "width": 1134.451904296875, "x": 2028.5536, "y": 1099.8652}, {"angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": [], "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 1, "fontSize": 15, "frameId": null, "groupIds": ["museum-hand24"], "height": 18.75, "id": "mw97xhhngegppxys2t", "index": "bRI", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "厅的位置和角度仍是第十五稿的；内容是暂定的（设）。灰交叉线 = 退进去的玻璃（深阴影）；蓝斜线 = 玻璃；绿斜线 = 种植平台；绿虚线块 = 埋在山里的厅", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 733067296, "source": "frontend_sync", "strokeColor": "#555", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "syncTimestamp": "2026-11-09T12:21:55.344Z", "syncedAt": "2026-11-09T12:21:55.410Z", "text": "厅的位置和角度仍是第十五稿的；内容是暂定的（设）。灰交叉线 = 退进去的玻璃（深阴影）；蓝斜线 = 玻璃；绿斜线 = 种植平台；绿虚线块 = 埋在山里的厅", "textAlign": "left", "type": "text", "updated": 1794226850312, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1627038752, "verticalAlign": "top", "width": 1064.52001953125, "x": 2028.5536, "y": 1129.8652}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}}